---
/** The one line from this module that ends up on the printed field card (C-4).
 *  Authored inline so it sits in context; the canonical list lives in the
 *  module's frontmatter and is what /field-card/ prints.
 *
 *  A <div> rather than a <p>: MDX wraps slotted prose in a paragraph, and a
 *  paragraph inside a paragraph gets hoisted straight back out by the parser. */
---
<div class="fieldline">
  <span class="fieldline__tag">Field card</span>
  <div class="fieldline__text"><slot /></div>
</div>
